      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25722/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook beef in a large pot over medium heat until browned and crumbly, about 5 to 7 minutes; drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qCN8CqfcRgOB5yM3OuzUpne78Kw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25722-pumpkin-chili-VAT-step-02-653f08145bcd4267bb38f029e6ea2115.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25722/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add onion and bell pepper; cook and stir for 5 minutes. Stir in beans, tomato juice, diced tomatoes, and pumpkin puree. Season with pumpkin pie spice, chili powder, and sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/p0DGgjlt2VWmI5hd9ntYAAADwK0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25722-pumpkin-chili-VAT-step-03-5a180d2f4a2c4b8cb6d3ff43442e31a7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25722/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simmer chili until thickened and flavors have blended, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
